<title>UK: TMCC sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.00     MATURITY    10.APR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  85 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
